  "notes": [
    "Pots and stacks follow each key's line at 100 big blinds: 550 after r250.c and 9750",
    "behind; 1100 and 9475 after the flop x.b275.c; 2750 and 8650 after the turn x.b825.c.",
    "Every sized bet stays under half the stack behind at every root-street node (825 of",
    "9475 on the turn, 2063 of 8650 on the river), so neither the engine's 67 percent",
    "all-in threshold nor the oracle's thresholds (set to 0, disabled) reshape the tree.",
    "A range is its pieces joined by commas, in the notation both parsers read: pairs with",
    "plus, suited and offsuit classes with plus, dash ranges, explicit combos written high",
    "rank first, and :weight. Each side holds 100 to 300 live combos on its board.",
    "All eight spots are gated and rake-free; the two informational raked twins live in",
    "g4-spots-raked.json (O-161), a list of its own because a node dump holds each key once.",
    "The preflop block is descriptive (O-164): the engine mapping never reads it.",
    "The configuration is cfg_6_online_100, BB against BTN after r250.c (O-52); no number",
    "comes from a reference tool (O-26, ADR 0017)."
  ]
